 "unsourced_claims": [
  "Search-ad leads averaged $66.02 in LocaliQ's healthcare benchmarks, and agency retainers for independent practices are commonly quoted at $2,500\u2013$10,000 a month, with ad spend billed on top.",
  "Mixing them up is why you see $50 and $800 healthcare lead generation cost claims on the same search page.",
  "The most-cited benchmark is $66.02 per lead for healthcare search ads, from LocaliQ.",
  "By specialty, it ranges from about $18.54 for dermatology to $141.17 for mental health.",
  "That's why dermatology CPL sits near $18.54 in LocaliQ's search data, while some agencies publish blended figures of $50\u2013$140 for the same specialty.",
  "For an independent practice, expect about $2,500\u2013$10,000 a month in fees, with media on top.",
  "Multi-location groups are commonly quoted around $6,000\u2013$15,000 a month plus media, since each added location brings its own listings, landing pages, call tracking and reporting.",
  "Say you buy 100 leads at $60, which is $6,000."
 ],
